---
import APIPage from '../layouts/api.astro';
---
<APIPage title="API Documentation">
    <h1>funkin</h1>
    <hr/>
    <h2>Welcome to the Codename Engine API documentation!</h2>
    <br/>These pages contains the entire documentation for the Codename Engine.
    <br/><br/>
    You can find the Wiki for the engine itself <a href={(import.meta.env.DEV?'':import.meta.env.BASE_URL)+'/wiki/index/'}>here</a>.
    <br/>
    You can find the Discord server for the engine <a href="https://discord.gg/codename-crew">here</a>.
    <br/>
    You can instantly go to a github page for the api by clicking the button on the top right that says View source.
</APIPage>